        "id": 1259838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-05-08T21:39:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we should add more comments around this parameter. Is the charge port either 0 (for the single case) otherwise is matches up with USB-C ports?\n\nOr if the above is not true and it is more complicated than that, then maybe we should define a board-level enum that defines what each charge port represents.",
      "revId": "e367fde37b3cd34ce29420589d68d18071963032",
