      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-05-08T21:39:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This needs a undef section above that describe what the CONFIG_BC12_SINGLE_DRIVER option means.\n\nWhat if USB_CHG_P0 and USB_CHG_P1 were defined, wouldn\u0027t that be multiple bc12 drivers?",
      "range": {
