      "message": "#ifdef removed (lacking USB_CHG task caused some compile error before, but the issue is no longer exists now)\n\nIf USB_CHG_P0 and USB_CHG_P1 are defined, I\u0027m assuming this means multiple port (and maybe multiple chip) but single driver for backward compatibility.",
